# Data files
# - data/game-exports/ = Raw exports from SMAPI mod (DO NOT COMMIT - large, user-specific)
# - data/rules/ = Game rules and mechanics (DO COMMIT - our formulas/mappings)
# - data/processing/ = Intermediate files during processing (DO NOT COMMIT - temporary/debugging)
# - data/processed/ = Processed data (DO COMMIT - output of process-game-data.cjs)
# - public/data/ = Compiled pages (DO NOT COMMIT - generated at build time)
data/game-exports/
data/processing/
public/data/
